                        "glosses": [
                            "to percolate, to leak, to ooze, to seep out, to exudate, to soak, to trickle (through), to filter"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ea82d412-32a8-4982-a748-d0b92ca4414c",
                                "sense_id": "7617c904-21a7-3fb0-8962-94d26ef19244",
                                "text": "За кана́вой начина́лся луг, сперва́ сухо́й, пото́м вла́жный, пото́м уже́ совсе́м боло́тистый: вода́ проса́чивалась везде́, стоя́ла лу́жицами.",
                                "translation": "Beyond the stream began a wide meadow, at first dry, then wet, and at last quite boggy; the water oozed up everywhere, and stood in pools in some places.",
                                "english": "Beyond the stream began a wide meadow, at first dry, then wet, and at last quite boggy; the water oozed up everywhere, and stood in pools in some places."
                            }
                        ]
